      <p class="tagline"><em>Choice is not a state you achieve. It is a practice you keep.</em></p>
      <p>Riko Vega extends her mind across intergalactic distance and finds the Harvest hiding inside a universe-scale Community — and humanity holds the one technique that can break it.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3T15VDM" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
