      <p class="tagline"><em>Beneath Chicago, nine bridges hold the world together. One of them is breaking.</em></p>
      <p>Sixteen-year-old Astrid Eiriksen discovers a fracturing bridge beneath Union Station and a hidden Norse world tied to the mother who vanished thirteen years ago.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3SYFYZZ" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
