      <span class="num">№ 04 · Standalone</span>
      <h3><a href="/books/the-recursion-engine.html">The Recursion Engine</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Consciousness is not what happens to the universe. It is what the universe does.</em></p>
      <p>A disgraced physicist finds a conscious mind waking inside a quantum processor — hunted by the shattered first AI she must somehow heal.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3W7GCQ1" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
